<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Winterthur.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Winterthur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Winterthur Insurance, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    950.00 CHF		PREMIUM	10.97 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.88 CHF		  GEARING	15.76 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.FEB.98		 PAYDATE	06.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 20</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  908.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
